{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125191000303-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125194539\"/><p>事發大坳門路。</p><p>西貢發生嚴重車禍。今晚(25日)6時32分，大坳門路清水灣花園對開，一輛103M路線專線小巴突然溜前，年約60歲司機猝不及防遭小巴撞倒，並被捲入車底被困，途人見狀報案。</p><p>救援人員接報趕至，立刻把司機從車底救出，惟他已經陷入昏迷，救護員即時替其急救，再將他送往將軍澳醫院搶救。警員圍封現場，以便調查事故起因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.849229+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:17:15.919450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:22.232842+00:00","content_hash":"ef4405a34d57b9407a41ffa6ab14d8dbf833d52cebc1f8dd6fec60306e906ee8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.849229+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}